# Brill: Whispers of the Scarlet (mod-brill-home, tools/town/scarlet.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Magistrate
# Sevren's five quests. The couriers' burnt letters, the town questioned (the market, the tavern), the
# lamps and the zealot in the cellar, Lowell Marsh the lamplighter confronted, and let go down the west
# road (the "escaped" mark, 970507): gone from Brill for this character, Sevren's greeting changed.
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
# Lowell Marsh is in the square for a character who hasn't decided his fate (the line's phase).
go 0 2237.5 287.0 35.2
wait 2
cmd .remix guid 970500
expect Wrath Remix guid: 970500
# Letters in the Ashes: Sevren in the town hall.
go 0 2304.0 267.0 38.8
talk 1499
accept 1499 970500
# Four Scarlet Couriers in the hollow northeast of town, and the three campfires' letters.
go 0 2488.0 160.0 29.5
kill 970501
kill 970501
kill 970501
kill 970501
go 0 2486.0 159.5 29.1
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970500
go 0 2501.0 176.5 30.1
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970500
go 0 2471.0 163.5 30.1
cmd .brilltown use
expect complete 970500
go 0 2304.0 267.0 38.8
talk 1499
reward 1499 970500
expect rewarded 970500
# Eyes Among Us: Innkeeper Renee, Mrs. Winters and Abigail Shiel questioned; the cistern's loose stones and
# the chalk-marked crate behind the tavern.
talk 1499
accept 1499 970501
go 0 2268.0 247.0 34.3
talk 5688
select 5688 odd hours
expect credit 970501 970503 1/1
go 0 2254.0 271.0 34.4
talk 2134
select 2134 asking about the Deathguard
expect credit 970501 970504 1/1
go 0 2258.5 277.0 34.9
talk 2118
select 2118 by the well after dark
expect credit 970501 970505 1/1
go 0 2292.3 314.3 35.6
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970501
go 0 2282.5 258.5 34.5
cmd .brilltown use
expect complete 970501
go 0 2304.0 267.0 38.8
talk 1499
reward 1499 970501
# The Scarlet Informant: the notes at three street lamps, and the Captured Scarlet Zealot in the tavern's cellar.
talk 1499
accept 1499 970502
go 0 2270.5 327.3 34.8
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970503
go 0 2225.4 252.4 33.9
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970503
go 0 2280.6 434.3 34.3
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970503
go 0 2290.5 236.0 27.3
talk 1931
select 1931 charred letters
expect complete 970502
go 0 2304.0 267.0 38.8
talk 1499
reward 1499 970502
# The Promise of Life: Lowell confronted (turned in to him).
talk 1499
accept 1499 970503
go 0 2237.5 287.0 35.2
talk 970500
reward 970500 970503
expect rewarded 970503
# A Betrayer's Fate: let go down the west road. The mark set; Lowell gone from this character's Brill.
talk 970500
accept 970500 970504
talk 970500
select 970500 Take the west road
expect complete 970504
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has q970507
expect-not q970505
cmd .remix guid 970500
expect no creature 970500
# Back to Sevren: the quest turned in, his greeting (970517) the lamplighter gone.
go 0 2304.0 267.0 38.8
talk 1499
reward 1499 970504
expect rewarded 970504
talk 1499
expect gossip text 970517
